  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Elevate your downtime with the adidas Adimule, a premium fusion of streetwear energy and casual ease. These slides redefine relaxation with a plush suede upper and footbed paired with a real cork sole for a natural, grounded feel. Finished with debossed Trefoil details, these mules provide unmistakable style whether you are at home or out in the city.<br><ul><li>Premium suede upper with debossed Trefoil details for signature style</li><li>Real cork sole and suede footbed offer natural cushioning</li><li>Closed toe mule silhouette provides a contemporary streetwear look</li><li>Rubber outsole delivers durability and traction for everyday wear</li><li>Easy slip-on construction ensures immediate comfort and convenience</li></ul><br><b>Material & Care</b><br><ul><li>Leather upper</li><li>Textile lining</li><li>Rubber outsole</li></ul><br><b>Size & Fit</b><br><ul><li>Regular fit</li></ul></p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas Originals Adimule Slides - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Off White/Preloved Brown/Aurora Coffee</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px